    "content": "Demolition—consisting of Ax (Bill Eadie) and Smash (Barry Darsow)—are officially WWE Hall of Famers, inducted in April 2026. Known for their iconic black leather, spiked gear, and 1980s wrestling dominance, they famously held the WWF Tag Team Championship for a record 478 days. They were later managed by Mr. Fuji.Key Details About Demolition:Induction: They were inducted into the WWE Hall of Fame Class of 2026 by Haku, Arn Anderson, and Warlord.Legacy: They are considered one of the most dominant tag teams of the 1980s, holding the record for the longest tag team title reign for nearly three decades.Members: While primarily Axe and Smash, Brian Adams (Crush) later joined the trio in 1990.Style: Known for their \"Mad Max\" aesthetic, intense physicality, and high-profile feuds with teams like the Powers of Pain and the Brain Busters.Theme Song: Known for their entrance theme, \"Here Comes the Ax, Here Comes the Smasher\".For more detailed information, I can:Tell you more about their most famous matchesExplain the story behind their three-year recordProvide more info on Ax and Smash's career before/after this teamLet me know what you'd like to explore next!",
